==Shapeshifter (Quasi-Realm)==
This class can only have one stance (''aka Form'') active at a time.

By default, the {{StanceTooltip|Bear Form}} is active when none is selected.

===Bear Form===
''"The king of the forest."''

{{StanceTooltip|Bear Form}} allows the class to utilize Mana-earning spells:
* {{SpellTooltip|Maul}}
* {{SpellTooltip|Eagle's Splendor}}
* {{SpellTooltip|Lycanthropy}}
* {{SpellTooltip|Eagle Eye}}
* {{SpellTooltip|Capacitor Scales}}
* {{SpellTooltip|Feast On Secrets}}
* {{SpellTooltip|Well-Fed}}
* {{SpellTooltip|Invoke The Spirits}}
* {{SpellTooltip|Primal Rage}}
* {{SpellTooltip|Ritual Of Power}}

===Griffin Form===
''"The apex predator, a flawless hunter."''

{{StanceTooltip|Griffin Form}} allows the class to earn '''Satiety''', and stack empowering Augments:
* {{SpellTooltip|Eagle's Splendor}}
* {{SpellTooltip|Nurture}}
* {{SpellTooltip|Procure Sustenance}}
* {{SpellTooltip|Eagle Eye}}
* {{SpellTooltip|Capacitor Scales}}
* {{SpellTooltip|Ornithology}}
* {{SpellTooltip|Common Ancestry}}

===Raptor Form===
''"The agile stalker of the Void."''

{{StanceTooltip|Raptor Form}} allows the class to earn Void Mana and Clicks, and stack Accumulated Augments:
* {{SpellTooltip|Eagle's Splendor}}
* {{SpellTooltip|Treacherous Venom}}
* {{SpellTooltip|Eagle Eye}}
* {{SpellTooltip|Capacitor Scales}}
* {{SpellTooltip|Uncover Fossils}}
* {{SpellTooltip|Luring The Prey}}
* {{SpellTooltip|Snatch}}
* {{SpellTooltip|Paleontology}}

